    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gallagher Quigley is delighted to present No. 25 Strand Road to the market in walk in condition— a charming, unique, end-of-terrace period home boasting stunning, uninterrupted sea views across Baldoyle Bay towards Irelands Eye, from Portmarnock Point to Sutton Golf Club. Baldoyle Bay is a designated Special Area of Conservation and Special Protection Area, renowned for its natural beauty and birdlife, offering a truly unique coastal setting.\r\n \r\nThis picturesque home enjoys breathtaking sunrise views to the east from the front, creating a bright and uplifting start to each day. Positioned at the end of a terrace, the property benefits from a gravel driveway to the front, with parking for up to two cars.\r\n\r\nTo the rear lies a sun drenched, walled, private south-west facing courtyard garden — an ideal space for outdoor dining and relaxation, with sunlight flooding the back of the house throughout the afternoon and evening.\r\n \r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hallway with guest WC. From here, double doors lead into a bright, open-plan kitchen and dining area to the rear, which overlooks and opens directly onto the sun-soaked, private, courtyard. To the front, a cosy living room enjoys beautiful sea views and features an attractive iron fireplace, adding warmth and character to the space.\r\n \r\nUpstairs, the landing leads to two well-proportioned double bedrooms, featuring high ceilings and original doors together with a family bathroom with walk-in shower.\r\n \r\nNo. 25 Strand Road, is a truly special home that has been lovingly maintained and upgraded by the same home owners  for many years, retaining its charm and character throughout. Its unique appeal can only be truly appreciated by viewing.\r\n \r\nThis coastal location is second to none. Situated close to Baldoyle village and church, with a selection of local cafés and amenities nearby, the property is also within easy reach of Sutton Cross, offering a wide range of shops, restaurants, and services. Sutton DART station is approximately a 10-minute walk away, providing excellent transport links to the city centre. Scenic coastal walks towards Howth and Portmarnock can be enjoyed just moments from your doorstep."
      },
      {
